        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Komatose</i> is a psychological horror point-and-click adventure that drags you into the dark corners of your own mind. After being violently attacked in a quiet town—one where crime is almost unheard of—you slip into a trauma-induced coma. But even in unconsciousness, you can't escape. Your mind becomes a twisted landscape, a distorted reflection of the hospital in which you are recovering, and you must navigate it to uncover the truth about what happened.</p>",
